			"notes": "More polish\n\n- Prevent players from initiating a teleport when they crouch while inside the top quarter of the block's empty space. Upwards travel is unaffected.\n\n- Prevent players in survival mode from accessing Creative Item Boxes' inventories\n\n- Prevent Item Boxes from dropping their contents while `doTileDrops` is true\n\n- Allow Item Boxes to *dispense* items while `doTileDrops` is true"
