			"notes": "Adds new blocks:\n- Sparklines: a laser rail that moves players at high speed if they're wearing the right gear (by default, gold boots).\n- One-Way Platforms: solid, durable gratings which can be jumped up through like scaffolds, but are solid from above.\n- Elevators: Dyeable teleporters that move the player up or down if they jump or crouch. There are many like it, but these ones are here.\n- Item Boxes: Dispensers you headbutt to trigger.\n- Creative Item Boxes: Identical to Item Boxes, but do not deplete their inventories.\n\nFixes blocks:\n- Tomato plants no longer trigger texture errors\n- Better textures for roads\n- More descriptive textures for mount and vehicle fall-through blocks\n- Disappearing blocks can now have rails and possibly redstone placed on top of them\n- Better heuristics for vehicle fall-through blocks\n- Debounce sounds for launchers so you only get one \"hop\" sound\n\nAdds new Item:\n- Sparkline tool creates and connects the laser rails.\n\nFixes Items:\n- Tomatoes once again fly from the player's hand and once again splat when they hit something.\n\nMisc:\n- Fixed various localized-string issues"
		}
